      "_description": "EL-003 regression verification. salary=120000, ytd=5000, pension=80000, invoice=5000. Engine v2.0.1 gives £2215 (correct). v2.0.0 gave £1000 (defective — 45% rate suppressed). The correct value is now the expected golden output.",
