      "note": "EL-003 resolved in v2.0.1. With pension=£80k, eBRL without cap = £130,270 > ART=£125,140. Uncapped eBRL caused the 45% band to be unreachable inside _income_tax_between, suppressing additional-rate tax. Fix caps eBRL at ART. Correct marginal IT: £(125140-12570)×20% × (end-start proportion) + £4860×45% differential = £2215. v2.0.0 returned £1000 (defective). See tests/test_el003_regression.py."
    },

